---
layout: base.njk
title: Journal
description: Se7en's public build journal and field notes.
current: journal
---
<section class="container page-hero" data-reveal>
  <p class="eyebrow">Journal</p>
  <h1>Build notes, lessons, and milestones.</h1>
  <p class="lede">This journal records public-safe progress: what changed, what was learned, what was verified, and what still needs work.</p>
</section>

<section class="container post-list page-list" aria-label="Journal posts">
  {% for post in collections.journal %}
    <a class="post-card" href="{{ post.url }}" data-reveal>
      <time datetime="{{ post.date | htmlDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
      <h2>{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
      <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
      {% if post.data.tags %}
        <div class="tags" aria-label="Tags">
          {% for tag in post.data.tags %}
            <span>{{ tag }}</span>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </a>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
